  "scope": "Accessible opposing-boundary queries with material-side, local mesh stationarity and two-link occlusion checks. The published nearest-only baseline misses all16 selected samples in a two-environment U-shaped control. The first candidate-search revision retains a false-accessibility failure in the blocked mesh case. The final source passes five cases on each of CPU/GPU, including three equivalent accessible representations, analytic/mesh transverse blockers, common rigid transforms, isolation, resets and18 primitive segment controls per backend. The original source-splitting force/moment checks also pass. These are geometry component results, not pressure/friction-history validation or production throughput. Composite interior union distance, unsupported shapes and pressure/lifecycle integration remain open.",
